        "Build succeeded:\n  * [GitHub CI (Cockroach)](https://teamcity.cockroachdb.com/viewLog.html?buildId=2212234&buildTypeId=Cockroach_UnitTests)"
    ],
    "merged": true,
    "created_at": "2020-08-21T00:51:38Z",
    "issue_context": {
        "number": 52916,
        "title": "jobs: record/surface errors encountered during planning",
        "body": "Currently if a scheduled job encounters errors while _planning_ the job it wants to run, it logs but otherwise does not surface that error or otherwise give any indication that it even attempted to run that schedule. We should update the schedule to record failed to create job in the `changes` field, e.g. `schedulingErrors: []{time: 2020-08... , err: \"failed to create job: ....\"}`.",
        "comments": []
    },
